# Pinned SHA-256 of the OpenSSH portable release whose `ssh -G` is the oracle for
# the ssh_config differential tests, and whose source tree the OpenSSH citations
# in this repository name. tools/ci/build_openssh.sh refuses any tarball that
# does not match, and the build-openssh action keys its cache on this file.
#
# The 10.0p1 tarball's version.h declares SSH_PORTABLE "p2", so the ssh it
# builds reports "OpenSSH_10.0p2"; the mirrors serve openssh-10.0p2.tar.gz as a
# byte-identical copy. https://www.openssh.com/txt/release-10.0 lists this
# digest, base64-encoded, as AhoucJoO30JQsSVr1anlAEEakN3avqgw7VnO+Q652Fw=.
021a2e709a0edf4250b1256bd5a9e500411a90dddabea830ed59cef90eb9d85c  openssh-10.0p1.tar.gz
